Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《神偷奶爸》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问 先生 这里有洗手间吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir, is there a commode?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾斯廷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 亲爱的 给我拍张手举金字塔的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, honey, take my picture. I got the pyramid in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾斯廷 你快给我回来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justin, you get back here right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 站住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 不! 拦住他! - 快回去! 别爬!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no! Stop him! - Go back! Don't climb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动 放松 小朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Easy, little boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 站住 孩子! 站着别动 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, stop, child! Stop right there. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不! 他掉下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! There he goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾斯廷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能接住! 我能接住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got him! I've got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚 埃及曝出一条爆炸性的新闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outrage in Egypt tonight as it was discovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡夫金字塔遭人偷走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the Great Pyramid of Giza had been stolen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,取而代之的竟然是一只巨大的充气仿制品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and replaced by a giant inflatable replica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事件引起全球恐慌 各国人民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is panic throughout the globe as countries and citizens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在尽力保护自己国家的地标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}try to protect their beloved landmarks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,执法部门仍然毫无线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Law enforcement still has no leads,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在猜测 到底哪个大坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leaving everyone to wonder, which of the world's villains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才是这起卑劣罪行的主谋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is responsible for this heinous crime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的下一步行动又是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where will he strike next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我心情很坏很坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having a bad, bad day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是现在 火力全开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time that I get my way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼前的一切全都碾烂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steamrolling whatever I see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷冻光线! 冷冻光线! 冷冻光线!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze ray! Freeze ray! Freeze ray!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我心情很坏很坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having a bad, bad day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要因此恨我 我也不会记怀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you take it personal, that's okay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看好了 这可不好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch, this is so fun to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是大坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despicable me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早啊 格鲁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Gru!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.13,0:05:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Fred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提醒你一下 你家的狗把我家院子 拉得到处都是狗屎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FYI, your dog has been leaving little bombs all over my yard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我可不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 这也没办法 狗就是喜欢到处乱跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. You know dogs. They go wherever they want to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死了就不会乱跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.53,0:05:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开玩笑的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm joking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可我也没说错 祝你愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, it is true. Anyway, have a good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼前的一切全都碾烂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steamrolling whatever I see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是大坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despicable me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我心情很坏很坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having a bad, bad day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要因此恨我 我也不会记怀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you take it personal, that's okay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是大坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despicable me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to be pulling on my leg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要买饼干吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cookies for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走开 家里没人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away. I'm not home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人 我听见你说话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you are. I heard you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你没听见 这是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you didn't. This{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是录音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a recording.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 不是录音 - 就是录音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it isn't. - Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.33,0:06:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 有事请留言 哔--{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this. Leave a message, beep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 录音先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, recorded message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾格妮丝 快跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agnes, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坏狗狗! 不! 不 不 坐下 我的小松饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad dog! No! No, no. Sit. My muffin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼法里奥博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr Nefario.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你现在是什么感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you must be feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我也一样 正承受着巨大的挫败感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, too, have encountered great disappointment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:07:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你在我眼里 永远都是最伟大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but in my eyes, you will always be one of the greats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了? 出什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新闻上都在播呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all over the news!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某个家伙盗走了一座金字塔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some fella just stole a pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都说跟他相比 我们这些其他坏蛋都...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're saying he makes all other villains look{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太菜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,集合喽罗们开会!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assemble the minions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喽啰们 集合了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minions, assemble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:07:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,气色不错啊 凯文! 家里人都好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking good, Kevin! How is the family? Good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.99,0:08:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是我的小Billy! 你好吗 Larry?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my Billy boy! What up, Larry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 很好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, all right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安静 安静!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simmer down. Simmer down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们也应该都听说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I realize that you guys probably heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某个坏蛋偷走了金字塔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about this other villain who stole the pyramids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这确实很牛B{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, it's a big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人人都说这是世纪大案什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are calling it the crime of the century and stuff like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会为这个紧张吗? 不会!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But am I upset? No, I am not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有那么一丁点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们今年也干得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we have had a pretty good year ourselves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的名字全都记在功劳簿上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you guys are all right in my book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 别得意!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no raises!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没什么好得意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going to get any raises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都做了些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们偷走了时代广场上的大屏幕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we stole the Times Square JumboTron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的风格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都喜欢用那东西看橄榄球是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you all like watching football on that, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不止这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还偷走了自由女神像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stole the Statue of Liberty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然是拉斯维加斯那个迷你版的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the small one from Las Vegas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有艾菲尔铁塔! 也是拉斯维加斯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I won't even mention the Eiffel Tower! Also Vegas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我当时还不想说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I wasn't going to tell you about this yet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我正在策划一项大工程!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I have been working on something very big!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金字塔那事跟它根本没法比!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that will blow this pyramid thing out of the water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还多亏了我的好朋友尼法里奥博士...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thanks to the efforts of my good friend Dr Nefario...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他多有型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's styling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们查到一间秘密实验室里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we have located a shrink ray{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藏着缩小射线 只要我们把它到手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a secret lab, and once we take this shrink ray,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will have the capability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,犯下真正意义上的世纪大案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to pull off the true crime of the century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去偷的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going to steal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 等等! 我还没说是什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait! I haven't told you what it is yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴夫 注意听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dave, listen up, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来 我们要去偷的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, we are going to steal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这时候停顿一下才给力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pause for effect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,月球!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the moon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦月球落到我手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once the moon is mine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要我交出来的话 整个世界都得满足我的任何条件!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world will give me whatever I want to get it back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我就会成为前无古人 后无来者的超级大坏蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will be the greatest villain of all time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我要说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.07,0:11:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 格鲁? 我做了下预算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Gru? I've been crunching some numbers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可没那么多钱玩这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I really don't see how we can afford this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不可行 我可创造不了奇迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be done. I'm not a miracle worker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 别紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, chillax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再去银行贷笔款 他们都喜欢我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just get another loan from the bank. They love me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.61,0:12:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊迪丝 别玩了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edith, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛? 我就走路嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I'm just walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(哈蒂小姐女童收留所)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 哈蒂小姐 我们回来了 - 嗨 哈蒂小姐 我们回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Miss Hattie. We're back. - Hi, Miss Hattie. We're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好 姑娘们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, girls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不在的时候 有人来领养我们吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody come to adopt us while we were out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊迪丝! 你把什么放我桌上了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edith! What did you put on my desk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泥巴派{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mud pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.35,0:12:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样可别想有人来领养 伊迪丝 知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're never gonna get adopted, Edith. You know that, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 知道了 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I know. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 指标完成得怎么样啊? 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how did it go, girls? Did we meet our quotas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们卖了43个薄荷饼干 30个巧克力卷 还有18个椰子饼干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sold 43 mini-mints, 30 choco-swirlies, and 18 coco-nutties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 今天卖得很不错喽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you say that like it's a great sale day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看我的表情!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还觉得今天卖得不错吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you still think it's a great sale day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,18个椰子饼干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighteen coco-nutties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们还能做得好些 是不是啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can do a little better than that, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都不想在周末关小黑屋吧? 不想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wouldn't want to spend the weekend in the Box of Shame, would we? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不想 哈蒂小姐 - 不想 哈蒂小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, Miss Hattie. - No, Miss Hattie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 走吧 把我的衣服洗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, good. Off you go. Go clean something of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 Penny - 嗨 Penny{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Penny. - Hi, Penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 你们好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 妈妈 抱歉 我想给你打电话的来着 可是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mom. Sorry, I meant to call, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来祝贺你把金字塔搞到手的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to congratulate you on stealing the pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你干的 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was you, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有哪个坏蛋能这么牛B呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or was it a villain who's actually successful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像您说的 妈妈 我是在准备一件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just so you know, Mom, I am about to do something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊天动地的大事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's very, very big, very important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道后 会为我非常骄傲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you hear about it, you're going to be very proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那祝你好运吧 好了 我要挂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck with that. Okay, I'm out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(坏蛋银行)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是格鲁 来找Perkins先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gru to see Mr. Perkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 找个位子坐一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, please have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我来说也许只是一小步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one small step for man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但对整个人类却是一个跨越{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one giant leap for mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 我以后也要登月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma, someday I'm going to go to the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕你这话说晚了 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid you're too late, Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宇航局不再送猴子去做试验了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}NASA isn't sending the monkeys any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥在申请做新坏蛋的贷款 以维克特的名义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm applying for a new villain loan. Go by the name of Vector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个数学名词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mathematical term,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是带箭头的物理量 既有方向又有能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a quantity represented by an arrow, with both direction and magnitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克特! 就是哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vector! That's me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为哥作的案既有方向又有能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm committing crimes with both direction and magnitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦也!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我新发明的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out my new weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,食人鱼发射枪! 哦也!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piranha gun! Oh, yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能发射活的食人鱼 见过没? 当然没见过了 这可是哥发明的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fires live piranhas. Ever seen one before? No, you haven't. I invented it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要给你做个演示吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want a demonstration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的! 有时候要把食人鱼装回去还真不简单...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot! So difficult, sometimes, to get the piranha back inside of my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁先生 Perkins先生现在可以见你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gru, Mr. Perkins will see you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是 我只需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, all I need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,银行能贷款给我造火箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is money from the bank to build a rocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那样的话 月球就是我们的了 - 哇哦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And then, the moon is ours. - Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.37,0:17:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这提议真给力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, very nice presentation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看这缩小射线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to see this shrink ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然了! 只要一到手就给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely! Will do. Soon as I have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说还没到手?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你还有脸来银行借钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet you have the audacity to ask the bank for money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道银行在你身上花多少钱了吗 格鲁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea of the capital that this bank has invested in you, Gru?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那些能真正赚钱的邪恶计划少得可怜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With far too few of your sinister plots actually turning a profit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我怎么忍受你? 好比你就是这个苹果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I put it? Let's say this apple is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没办法把那些钱都赢回来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't start getting our money back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:18:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 格鲁 关键是 现在新出道的坏蛋很多很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Gru, the point is, there are a lot of new villains out there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比你年轻 也比你更渴望成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}younger than you, hungrier than you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.75,0:18:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比你年轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}younger than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像门外那个叫维克特的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like that young fellow out there named Vector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金字塔就是他偷的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just stole a pyramid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了 明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got it. I've got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 要想贷款造火箭...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, as far as getting money for the rocket...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就去把缩小射线弄来 否则免谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the shrink ray, then we'll talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(东亚某秘密研究基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.91,0:20:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到手了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 嘿! 怎么回事! 嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey! What! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以后冻住别人脑袋之前先想清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, maybe you'll think twice before you freeze someone's head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期了 格鲁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long, Gru!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快! 别让他跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! We can't let him get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正前方! 正前方!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up ahead! Up ahead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.75,0:20:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开火! 快开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire! Fire, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没打中!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让爷来教训你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to papa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下你跑不掉了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you in our sights!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是探囊取...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like taking candy from a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 格鲁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gru!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看飞船变小会怎么样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try this on for size!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太诡异了 怎么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's weird. What is going...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会得幽闭恐惧症的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is claustrophobic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.47,0:21:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太小了! 这太小了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too small! This is too small for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.53,0:22:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨那小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate that guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...请照看我们 保佑我们睡个好觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and please watch over us, and bless that we'll have a good night's sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保佑我们在睡觉的时候 不会有虫子爬进耳朵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bless that while we're sleeping, no bugs will crawl into our ears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们脑子里产卵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lay eggs in our brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.97,0:22:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 谢谢你生动的描述 伊迪丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Thanks for that image, Edith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.22,0:22:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有请保佑我们很快就有人收养{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And please bless that someone will adopt us soon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸妈妈都对我们很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that the mommy and daddy will be nice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也能有只独角兽做宠物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have a pet unicorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.69,0:22:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿门 - 阿门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Amen. - Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,独角兽 我喜欢 独角兽 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unicorns, I love them Unicorns, I love them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,独角 独角兽 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uni, uni, unicorns I love them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,独角 独角兽 养只做宠物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uni, unicorns, I could pet one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真的有独角兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they were really real{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.66,0:22:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.87,0:23:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就能买一只来做宠物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I bought one so I could pet it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.84,0:23:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它爱我 我也爱它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it loves me Now I love it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(维克特的城堡)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.60,0:23:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(安全警报)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.50,0:24:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是...开什么玩笑...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you... What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运 小萝莉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, little girls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.75,0:25:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 真酷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.04,0:25:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我们是哈蒂女童收留所的孤儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi! We're orphans from Miss Hattie's Home for Girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.17,0:25:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不管 快滚! - 别这样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't care. Beat it! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.21,0:25:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得多卖饼干 才可能有好前途{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're selling cookies so, you know, we can have a better future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等! 你们有椰子饼干吗? - 有啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, wait! Do you have coco-nutties? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.53,0:25:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有办法了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light bulb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.75,0:25:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼法里奥博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr Nefario!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.17,0:25:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我造些饼干外形的微型小机器人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to need a dozen tiny robots disguised as cookies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 饼干机器人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Cookie robots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.55,0:25:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你谁啊? - 哦 算了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is this? - Oh, forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.60,0:26:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你的背景符合我们的要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it appears you have cleared our background check,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.93,0:26:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr Gru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.86,0:26:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见你整理的那张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see you have made a list{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.19,0:26:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对你颇有好评的病人名单了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of some of your personal achievements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我就爱看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for that. I love reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得过荣誉勋章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see you have been given the Medal of Honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.17,0:26:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还曾受爵位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a knighthood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.67,0:26:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我 我 我 - 我 我 我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me, me, me. - Me, me, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.26,0:26:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯文?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.22,0:26:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有过自己的厨艺节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had your own cooking show{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.43,0:26:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能屏住呼吸30秒?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can hold your breath for 30 seconds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.43,0:26:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这很一般嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.39,0:26:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.65,0:26:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打! 打! 打! 打! - 打! 打! 打! 打!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight! - Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.36,0:26:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是些什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the name of... What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.95,0:27:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's the dealio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.24,0:27:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我妻子Debbie过世后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things have been so lonely since my wife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.04,0:27:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人生就孤单起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Debbie, passed on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.63,0:27:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就好比 我的心是颗牙齿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like my heart is a tooth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.38,0:27:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而牙齿上蛀了个洞 只有孩子的爱才能填补好这个洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's got a cavity that can only be filled with children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.68,0:27:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.22,0:27:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很漂亮 你会说西班牙语吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a beautiful woman. Do you speak Spanish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.89,0:27:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看我像是会说西班牙语吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like I speak Spanish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.19,0:27:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的脸生得五顑六肿额{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a face como un burro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 谢谢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.24,0:27:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,言归正传 能继续谈收养问题了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, can we proceed with this adoption?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都迫不及待了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, so excited!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去叫玛歌, 伊迪丝和艾格妮丝到前厅来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell Margo, Edith and Agnes to come to the lobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.97,0:27:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜妈妈一定很漂亮!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet the mom is beautiful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.76,0:28:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜爸爸的眼神很动人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet the daddy's eyes sparkle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.97,0:28:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他们家里有的是大熊软糖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet their house is made of Gummi Bears.{\r}
