Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的毛毛虫变不成蝴蝶了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My caterpillar never turned into a butterfly.{\r}
