Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.28,0:28:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Debbie是个很幸运的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Debbie was a very lucky woman.{\r}
