Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.13,0:28:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘们 来见见格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls, I want you to meet Mr. Gru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是来收养你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to adopt you.{\r}
