Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.31,0:28:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.40,0:28:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我是玛歌 这是伊迪丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm Margo. This is Edith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.32,0:29:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是艾格妮丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's Agnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.24,0:29:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我抓住你腿了 我抓住你腿了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got your leg, I got your leg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.28,0:29:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 差不多行了 小丫头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that is enough, little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放开我的腿 快 你知道怎么做的 - 再高点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let go of my leg. Come on. You can do it. - Higher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.87,0:29:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再高点! - 你只要撒开手就行 哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Higher! - Just release your grip. Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.46,0:29:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你平时都是怎么弄开的? 有什么口令吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you remove them? Is there a command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.71,0:29:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是用了什么不粘材料?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some nonstick spray?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撬棍?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crowbar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.63,0:29:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 丫头们 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, girls, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦也!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相当震惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty impressive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.25,0:29:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看什么看?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.29,0:29:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找灭!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boo-ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.75,0:30:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你缩水啦 小小漱口剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got shrunk, tiny mouthwash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.38,0:30:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看招!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.55,0:30:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你完蛋了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You done been shrunk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.18,0:30:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我顺利搞到缩小射线了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the shrink ray, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.43,0:30:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没 我才没拿着它乱玩呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not playing with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.02,0:30:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gru?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.31,0:30:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别逗了! 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me laugh! No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.65,0:30:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说 他不可能偷到月亮的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}P.S., he is not getting the moon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.28,0:30:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再再说 等哥摆平他以后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and P.P.S., by the time I'm done with him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.41,0:30:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就只有求饶的份了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's gonna be begging for mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 拜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迷你小宝贝 专用的迷你小马桶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you, a little tiny toilet for a little tiny baby...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.75,0:30:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我咒你全家 破迷你马桶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curse you, tiny toilet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.43,0:30:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜蜜温馨的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home sweet home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.43,0:30:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这 就是你家?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is, like, your house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.14,0:30:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍等片刻...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a sec...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那个假装自动答录机的人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the guy who pretended he was a recorded message!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.36,0:31:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 那是别人干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that was someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.91,0:31:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以牵着我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I hold your hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.00,0:31:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.30,0:31:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从我们被这光头佬收养的那一刻起 我就觉得我们会落得像Annie那么惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we got adopted by a bald guy, I thought this'd be more like Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.11,0:31:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别咬 嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.49,0:31:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯尔 这些不是供你享用的 这些是我们的客人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, these are not treats. These are guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.74,0:31:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们 这是凯尔 我的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls, this is Kyle, my{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.45,0:31:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.33,0:31:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毛茸茸的狗狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fluffy doggy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.84,0:32:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么品种的狗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of dog is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.09,0:32:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是... 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a... I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.59,0:32:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的觉得这里适宜小朋友居住吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think that this is an appropriate place for little kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.30,0:32:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然不合适{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.01,0:32:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别 不要! 快出来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! Stay away from there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.48,0:32:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它经不起折腾的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fragile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.60,0:32:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我看计划要改成两个人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I suppose the plan will work with two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.15,0:32:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 这里面好暗啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! It's dark in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.82,0:32:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它把我的果汁戳了个洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It poked a hole in my juice box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如你们所见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.46,0:32:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经准备好了小孩子 可能用得上的所有东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have provided everything a child might need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.84,0:32:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.05,0:32:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我说的... 嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. As I was saying... Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.63,0:32:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人把它打破了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody broke that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.14,0:32:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 够了 很明显 我们得立些规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay. Clearly, we need to set some rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.89,0:32:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,规矩一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.81,0:33:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.48,0:33:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那地板呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the floor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.73,0:33:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你们可以踩在地板上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you may touch the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.86,0:33:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那空气呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.32,0:33:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你们可以接触空气!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you may touch the air!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.49,0:33:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那这个呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.70,0:33:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你从哪儿拿的? - 我找到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where did you get that? - Found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.74,0:33:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 规矩二 我工作的时候不准打扰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Rule number two. You will not bother me while I'm working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.62,0:33:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,规矩三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule number three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.58,0:33:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准大哭 抽泣 大笑 或者咯咯笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not cry or whine or laugh or giggle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.38,0:33:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不准打喷嚏 打嗝 或者放屁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or sneeze or burp or fart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.42,0:33:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是 千万千万 千万别弄出噪音 懂了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, no, no, no annoying sounds. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算是噪音吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this count as annoying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.43,0:33:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对噪音!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.10,0:33:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我六小时后再来看你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will see you in six hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.77,0:33:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 别担心 一切都会好起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, don't worry. Everything's going to be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.32,0:33:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这会很幸福的 对吧? 艾格妮丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be really happy here. Right? Agnes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.27,0:34:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问一下 这些是神马?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Question. What are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.19,0:34:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一打摇滚机器人! 动起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dozen boogie robots! Boogie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.74,0:34:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看好了 看我的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this. Watch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.66,0:34:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,饼干机器人 我说的是饼干机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cookie robots. I said cookie robots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.91,0:34:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么... 你怎么 你怎么就那么...守旧呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you so old?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.96,0:34:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我会搞定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.50,0:34:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.52,0:35:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电视!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TV!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.62,0:35:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.04,0:35:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们看呀 - 太酷了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at that! - That is cool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.30,0:35:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.09,0:35:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他不是牙医{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he's a dentist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.23,0:35:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们研究这个有些时日了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been working on this for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.15,0:35:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它叫做反重力糖浆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a anti-gravity serum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.62,0:36:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本打算关好窗的 他会没事的 我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant to close that. He'll be all right, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.12,0:36:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 药效会消失吗? - 目前来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do the effects wear off? - So far,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.25,0:36:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会 不会 现在看不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no. No, they don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.79,0:36:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个 毫无疑问 是你预定的新式武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here, of course, is the new weapon you ordered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.55,0:36:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是 "飞镖枪" 不是... 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said "dart gun", not... Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.10,0:36:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 这样啊 我还在奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. 'Cause I was wondering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.93,0:36:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况会用得上这玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under what circumstances would we use this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.64,0:36:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.19,0:36:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真正要给你展示的是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I really wanted to show you was this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是饼干机器人嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now those are cookie robots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.62,0:36:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啦 啦 啦 啦 我爱独角兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}La, la, la, la I love unicorns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.95,0:36:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么会在这儿? 我不是说了 在厨房带着吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here? I told you to stay in the kitchen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.71,0:36:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们太无聊了 这里是干嘛用的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got bored. What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.46,0:36:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个我能喝吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I drink this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.29,0:36:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想玩自爆吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to explode?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.38,0:36:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.51,0:37:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回厨房去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back in the kitchen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.55,0:37:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会和我们玩吗? - 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you play with us? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.10,0:37:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么? - 因为我很忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Because I'm busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.39,0:37:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忙什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doing what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.39,0:37:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 好吧 你赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, you got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.06,0:37:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牙医只是我的副业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dentist thing is more of a hobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真正的身份是间谍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In real life, I am a spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.32,0:37:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最高机密 你们不可以跟任何人说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is top secret, and you may not tell anybody,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.57,0:37:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 因为如果你们说了... - 这是用来做什么的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- because if you do... - What does this do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.53,0:37:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.50,0:37:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的独角兽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My unicorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.29,0:37:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得把它修好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.04,0:37:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,修? 它已经化成灰了 也就是说 它不可能修好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fix it? Look, it has been disintegrated. By definition, it cannot be fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.63,0:37:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别吓我 她这是要干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's freaking me out. What is she doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.89,0:37:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会一直摒着气 直到给她个新独角兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna hold her breath until she gets a new one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.43,0:37:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是个玩具而已 别闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is just a toy. Now stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.10,0:37:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 好啦 我会把它修好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay! I'll fix it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.65,0:37:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蒂姆 马克 菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tim! Mark! Phil!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.28,0:38:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这非常重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is very important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.61,0:38:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们必须给这个丫头弄个新独角兽玩偶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to get the little girl a new unicorn toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.16,0:38:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 嘿! 是玩偶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey! A toy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.21,0:38:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 要快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, and hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是 我的表亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are my cousins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.68,0:38:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞 斯图尔特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jerry! Stuart!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.30,0:38:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看好她们 让她们离我远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch them, and keep them away from me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.57,0:38:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.02,0:39:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你表弟的主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was your cousin's idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.52,0:39:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.06,0:39:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 该去睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, bedtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.86,0:40:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没说你们俩!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.86,0:40:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 睡觉觉 盖好被被 做个好梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okey-dokey. Beddie-bye. All tucked in. Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.49,0:40:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just so you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.41,0:40:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远都不会成为我爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're never gonna be my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.95,0:40:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会介意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can live with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.71,0:40:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些床是用炸弹做的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are these beds made out of bombs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.09,0:40:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不过它们已经老得不可能爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but they are very old and highly unlikely to blow up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.17,0:40:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过还是不要翻来翻去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But try not to toss and turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.39,0:40:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会给我们讲睡前故事吗? - 不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you read us a bedtime story? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.64,0:40:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不听故事我们会睡不着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can't go to sleep without a bedtime story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.81,0:40:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你的夜晚注定格外漫长了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then it's going to be a long night for you, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.23,0:40:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 晚安 好好睡 当心别被虫子咬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, good night, sleep tight, and don't let the bed bugs bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.94,0:40:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的虫子超多的哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there are literally thousands of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.91,0:40:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外 你们的衣橱里可能会有什么东西哟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's probably something in your closet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.62,0:40:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他开玩笑的 艾格妮丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just kidding, Agnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.02,0:41:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.34,0:41:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘们 出发了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.88,0:41:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送饼干去喽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to deliver the cookies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.68,0:41:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 但我们要先去上舞蹈课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. But first, we're going to dance class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.43,0:42:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 今天我们不会去上舞蹈课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, we're going to have to skip the dance class today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.44,0:42:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我们今天必须去上舞蹈课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, we can't skip the dance class today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.07,0:42:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上就要有个盛大的公演了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a big recital coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.15,0:42:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们在排练《天鹅湖》的片段 - 没错 《天鹅湖》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're doing an excerpt from Swan Lake. - Yeah, Swan Lake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.49,0:42:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 非常棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fantastic. Wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要去送饼干了! 来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're going to deliver cookies! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.58,0:42:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.50,0:42:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不上完舞蹈课 我们是不会去送饼干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going to deliver cookies until we do dance class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.92,0:42:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.13,0:42:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会开车送你们去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I am not driving you to dance class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.92,0:42:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你们想去 就自己走去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you want to go, you are going to have to walk yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.39,0:42:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们干吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走去上舞蹈课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walking to dance class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们! 好吧 好啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ya? Okay, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.65,0:42:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢走啊 我是绝对不会送你们去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just keep walking, because I'm really not driving you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.61,0:42:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.28,0:42:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁很生气 后果很严重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to suffer the wrath of Gru!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.24,0:43:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说真的 我数三下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, I'm going to count to three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.37,0:43:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好给我到车里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you had better be in this car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.41,0:43:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要数咯! 一! 二!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go! One! Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.12,0:43:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,... 三 四 五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...three, four and five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.79,0:43:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抬 伸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And lift, and stretch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.80,0:43:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一  二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one, and two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.47,0:43:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 给你 - 这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you go. - What is it?{\r}
