Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.71,0:43:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 我们的第一位顾客叫做维克特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Our first customer is a man named Vector.{\r}
