Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.40,0:44:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快结束了 就快成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost over. It's almost over.{\r}
