Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.29,0:44:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我要的饼干带来了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have my cookies for me?{\r}
