Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.35,0:44:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我很想知道 还有谁会订那么多饼干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. I'd like to see somebody else order that many cookies.{\r}
