Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.85,0:45:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你为什么要热身? - 有事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you warming up for? - Stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.27,0:45:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What sort of stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.40,0:45:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常带劲的事 你不会懂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Super-cool stuff you wouldn't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.90,0:45:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如睡觉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like sleeping?{\r}
