Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.81,0:48:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功啦! 快点 姑娘们 我们走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it! Come on, girls, let's go!{\r}
