Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.24,0:48:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生活总是不尽如人意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life is full of disappointments{\r}
