Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.42,0:48:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 - 拜托嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please? - Please?{\r}
