Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.56,0:49:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托啦! - 答应吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Come on!{\r}
