Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.11,0:49:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.99,0:49:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 玩开心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.37,0:49:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 哥们儿 她们必须有大人陪着才能玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, dude. They can't ride without an adult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.00,0:49:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
