Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.56,0:50:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它太可爱了 我受不了了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's so fluffy, I'm gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.94,0:50:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得让我们把它赢回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gotta let us play for it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.48,0:50:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 不不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.28,0:50:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.11,0:50:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个毛毛独角兽多少钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much for the fluffy unicorn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.87,0:50:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是非卖品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it is not for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.87,0:50:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须把那边那个宇宙飞船打倒 才能得到这个独角兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all you gotta do to win it is knock down that little spaceship there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.71,0:50:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很容易的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's easy!{\r}
