Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.48,0:51:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再一次!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.40,0:51:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等一下 - 拜托 再一次!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait! - Come on. One more time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.94,0:51:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.20,0:51:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不小心闭眼了刚刚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I accidentally closed my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.88,0:51:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我打到它了! 我打到它了! - 好厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hit it! I hit it! - That was cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.34,0:51:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 哇 哇 这算什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa. What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.97,0:51:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她打到了 我明明看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She hit that. I saw that with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.14,0:51:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 老兄 我给你解释解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy, let me explain something to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.98,0:51:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到那个小宇宙飞船了吗? 你看 它还没有被打倒吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that little tin spaceship? You see how it's not knocked over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.61,0:51:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是什么意思吗 教授?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what that means, professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.53,0:51:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意思就是 你得不到那个独角兽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means you don't get the unicorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.20,0:52:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某人的脸很难看哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's got a frowny face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.16,0:52:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好怕怕! 下次好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boo! Better luck next time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.79,0:52:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, my turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.94,0:52:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,倒了吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knocked over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.78,0:52:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好软啊 - 是呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's so fluffy! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.33,0:52:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太强了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.54,0:52:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把那些都炸了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blew up the whole thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.25,0:52:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧 去玩其他的游戏!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Let's try another game!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.67,0:52:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁 我能跟你说几句吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gru, do you mind if I have a quick word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.84,0:53:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 姑娘们 去玩吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, girls, go play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.64,0:53:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到缩小射线了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the shrink ray!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.57,0:53:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,棉花糖!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cotton candy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.78,0:53:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,距离月亮到达对我们 最有利的位置只有12天了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have 12 days until the moon is in optimum position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.82,0:53:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再东拉西扯了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't afford any distractions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.70,0:53:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我接通Perkins{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Perkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.00,0:53:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰你 Perkins先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to bother you, Mr. Perkins,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.21,0:53:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我认为 你会很想看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I figured that you would want to see this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.97,0:53:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.61,0:53:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 格鲁 出乎意料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Gru. Rather impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.19,0:54:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 剩下的事就简单多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the rest of the plan is simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.82,0:54:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我飞去月亮上 把月亮缩小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fly to the moon. I shrink the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.66,0:54:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把月亮拿走 然后我坐在马桶上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grab the moon. I sit on the toilet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.45,0:54:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.16,0:54:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 不好意思!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.37,0:54:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您能稍等下吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you excuse me for just one second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.59,0:54:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你们说 不要碰我的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you not to touch my things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.09,0:54:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了又说 我跟你们说了一百遍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, I told you. I've told you a thousand times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.17,0:54:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我们能叫份披萨吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, can we order pizza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.97,0:54:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,披萨? 你们不是刚吃的中饭吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pizza? You just had lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.97,0:54:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是现在吃 当晚饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now, for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.22,0:54:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚饭?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.85,0:54:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那... 好吧 好吧 好吧 随你们 乖乖到里面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just... Fine, fine, fine, whatever. Just get back in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.77,0:54:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能点厚底披萨吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we get stuffed crust?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.81,0:54:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 厚底披萨! - 厚底披萨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stuffed crust! - Stuffed crust!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.15,0:54:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你们全包进面皮里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stuff you all in the crust!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.73,0:54:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好好笑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're funny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.19,0:54:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再踏出那房间一步了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't come out of that room again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.49,0:54:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.45,0:54:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 刚刚说到哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that. Where were we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.95,0:54:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你坐在马桶上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were sitting on the toilet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.62,0:54:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 不是 抱歉 那只是我小幽默一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! No, I'm sorry. It was a little attempt at humor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.25,0:54:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你超爱笑的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how much you like to laugh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.50,0:55:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 内心深处 现在 我要说的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inside. Now, I was saying...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.93,0:55:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你精力不太集中 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seem terribly focused, Gru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.97,0:55:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 我绝对全神贯注{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I am completely focused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.43,0:55:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好! - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.52,0:55:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这有个巨人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy is huge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.77,0:55:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们上电视了吗? - 那是什么? 哪来的孩子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are we on TV? - What are those? Children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.27,0:55:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们又要干嘛? 跟你们说了别过来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? I told you to stay out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.28,0:55:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.61,0:55:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冰冻射线!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze ray!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.74,0:55:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gru?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.08,0:55:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.79,0:55:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I was saying...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.25,0:55:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No need to continue. I've seen quite enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.17,0:55:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但是我的计划... - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But my plan... - Is a great plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.63,0:55:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划很好 美中不足的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love everything about your plan, except for one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.68,0:55:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.27,0:55:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 妈妈 我画了张自己登月的画!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mom, I drew a picture of me landing on the moon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.94,0:56:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 妈妈 我用通心粉做了个微型火箭!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mom, I made a prototype of the rocket out of macaroni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.61,0:56:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 我照着通心粉火箭模型造了个真家伙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mom, I made a real rocket based on the macaroni prototype!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.25,0:56:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.34,0:56:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面对现实吧 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's face reality, Gru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.72,0:56:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个计划你已经跟进这么久了 却没取得什么进展{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been at this for far too long with far too little success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.68,0:56:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以银行决定 转而投资...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna put our faith, our money, into a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.73,0:56:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更年轻的坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a younger villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.44,0:56:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吧 再见 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over. Goodbye, Gru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.34,0:57:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道现在有些谣言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I know there have been some rumors going around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说银行已经撤资了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the bank is no longer funding us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.09,0:57:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得需要出来说明一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I am here to put those rumors to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.02,0:57:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谣言是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.89,0:57:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于投资{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In terms of money,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.27,0:57:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没钱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have no money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.53,0:57:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还怎么登月呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how will we get to the moon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.28,0:57:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,答案很明显{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.20,0:57:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去不成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.83,0:57:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.37,0:57:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们可以现在可以考虑另谋高就了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now would probably be a good time to look for other employment options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.88,0:57:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.09,0:57:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把自己的履历烧掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have fired up my resume{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.76,0:57:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我同样建议你们也这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I suggest that all of you do, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.30,0:57:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这干吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.81,0:58:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没看见我正在鼓舞士气吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you see that I am in the middle of a pep talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.76,0:58:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.22,0:58:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我们自己造火箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we will build our own rocket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.76,0:58:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竭尽所能 我们可以的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}using this and whatever else we can find!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.77,0:58:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都行! 刨垃圾堆! 把车拆了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab everything! Hit the junkyards! Take apart the cars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.89,0:58:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁他妈需要什么银行?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who needs the bank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.85,0:58:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始行动 动起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.04,0:59:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(临界危险)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.74,0:59:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(已安全)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.87,0:59:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈! 你怎么来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.95,0:59:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我正给他洗澡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here he is in the bathtub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.50,0:59:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他的小屁屁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at his little buns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.08,0:59:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.46,0:59:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这张 他当时要去做礼拜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here, he's all dressed up in his Sunday best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.68,0:59:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真像个女孩!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks like a girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.97,1:00:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不过丑了点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he does. An ugly girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.95,1:00:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太好玩了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're funny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.43,1:00:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(5月26号 天鹅湖公演 盗月)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.05,1:00:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了! 我的饼干像具尸体!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Mine's shaped like a dead guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.11,1:01:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Perkins先生 少爷来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Perkins, your son is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.74,1:01:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.75,1:01:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 老爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.25,1:01:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.79,1:01:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 威克特 - 我现在不叫威克特了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, I did, Victor. - I am not Victor any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.84,1:01:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威克特是上学时叫的 现在叫维克特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor was my nerd name. Now I am Vector!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.38,1:01:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.34,1:01:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道缩小射线在哪儿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where the shrink ray is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.18,1:01:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然! 在我那呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duh! Back at my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.22,1:01:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定? 在你那儿? 那太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, is that right? Back at your place? That's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.18,1:01:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那格鲁这个估计是仿制的吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess Gru must just have one that looks exactly like it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.02,1:01:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 是那些卖我饼干的小女孩!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the... Those girls sold me cookies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.57,1:01:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这次盗月计划可能有多赚钱吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how lucrative this moon heist could be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.41,1:01:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把这难得的大好良机给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you the opportunity of a lifetime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.28,1:01:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你却让它打了水漂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you just blow it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.99,1:01:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 我没有 - 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I didn't. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.71,1:01:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让格鲁等着吧 看我的最新武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just wait until Gru sees my latest weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.67,1:01:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼喷枪! 宝贝 来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squid-launcher! Oh, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.63,1:02:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有只乌贼掉我头上了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a squid on my face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.34,1:02:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别着急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.72,1:02:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,月亮逃不出我们的手掌心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moon is as good as ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.81,1:02:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on now, it's bedtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.39,1:02:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刷牙了吗? 我来闻闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you brush your teeth? Let me smell. Let me smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.19,1:02:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没刷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.65,1:02:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把睡衣穿上 不要乱动 好了 说真的 别闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on your PGs. Hold still. Okay, seriously! Seriously!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.82,1:02:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该说晚安了 不是开玩笑 真的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is beddie-bye time, right now. I'm not kidding around. I mean it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.41,1:02:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们一点都不累! - 我累了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But we're not tired! - Well, I am tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.24,1:02:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睡觉前能给我们讲个故事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you read us a bedtime story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.33,1:02:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.79,1:02:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.13,1:02:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么求也不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The physical appearance of the "please" makes no difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.05,1:02:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 赶快睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is still no, so go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.22,1:02:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睡不着 我们好兴奋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can't. We're all hyper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.43,1:02:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不念 我们就一直闹啊闹地吵你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And without a bedtime story, we'll just keep getting up and bugging you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.02,1:02:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个晚上哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All night long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.27,1:02:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.56,1:02:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 好吧 小猫困了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right. Sleepy Kittens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.03,1:03:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小猫困了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleepy Kittens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.78,1:03:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么? - 手指玩偶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are these? - Puppets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.65,1:03:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讲故事时要用到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You use them when you tell the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.04,1:03:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 那就开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's get this over with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.08,1:03:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"3只小猫爱玩耍 太阳下玩了一整天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Three little kittens loved to play, they had fun in the sun all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.42,1:03:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈妈过来说 宝贝们该睡觉"'{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then their mother came out and said, Time for kittens to go to bed."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.93,1:03:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦! 什么鬼东西 你们真的喜欢这个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! This is garbage. You actually like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.89,1:03:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续念!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep reading!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.14,1:03:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点! - 好吧 那继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - All right, all right, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.60,1:03:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"3只小猫大声吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Three little kittens started to bawl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.27,1:03:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈咪 不累咋睡觉"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy, we're not tired at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.69,1:03:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈咪笑了 喵喵说"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their mother smiled and said with a purr,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.32,1:03:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"好吧 至少把毛刷刷好"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, but at least you should brush your fur."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.07,1:03:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快刷毛毛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you brush the fur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.95,1:03:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也能出版?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is literature?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.78,1:03:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2岁小孩都会写了 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 2-year-old could have written this. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.58,1:03:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"3只小猫 毛都刷刷好"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Three little kittens with fur all brushed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.67,1:04:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"大叫说 睡不着 好兴奋!"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}said, We can't sleep, we feel too rushed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.17,1:04:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈咪笑了 用缎子般的声音说"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their mother replied, with a voice like silk,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.34,1:04:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"好吧 至少把牛奶都喝掉"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, but at least you should drink your milk."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.34,1:04:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂它们牛奶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now make them drink the milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.02,1:04:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书不好 真是没完没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like this book. This is going on forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.98,1:04:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"小猫们喝完牛奶 揉眼睛开始打哈欠"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Three little kittens, with milk all gone, rubbed their eyes and started to yawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.70,1:04:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"睡不着 一点都不困"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't sleep, we can't even try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.79,1:04:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接着猫妈妈唱起了摇篮曲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then their mother sang a lullaby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.58,1:04:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"'宝贝们晚安 闭上眼睡觉觉 一觉睡到大天亮"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night kittens, close your eyes. Sleep in peace until you rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.92,1:04:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"虽然我们分开睡"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though while you sleep, we are apart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.22,1:04:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"但妈咪永远爱你们哦"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your mommy loves you with all her heart."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.97,1:04:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完了 好了 都晚安吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end. Okay, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.31,1:04:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等下! - 又怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.65,1:05:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睡觉前能亲下我们吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about good night kisses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.48,1:05:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 亲亲抱抱都不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. There will be no kissing or hugging or kissing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.16,1:05:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会跟吻我们道晚安的 艾格妮丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is not gonna kiss us good night, Agnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.37,1:05:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢他 他真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like him. He's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.50,1:05:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点吓人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.08,1:05:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像圣诞老人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Santa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.89,1:05:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有48小时就起飞了 一切正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only 48 hours till the launch, and all systems are go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.36,1:05:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.53,1:05:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我在考虑 要不要换个时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking that maybe we could move the date of the heist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那天是三个丫头的公演 是不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me this is not as a result of the girls' dance recital, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.54,1:05:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.83,1:06:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公演? 怎么会... 那么傻!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The recital? Don't... That's stupid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.00,1:06:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是觉得星期天做这事很怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just think it's kind of weird to do it on a Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.96,1:06:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星期二怎么样 好不好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking, maybe a heist is a Tuesday thing, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.26,1:06:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格鲁 我们共事了那么多年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gru, you and I have been working on this for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.97,1:06:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的梦想啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's everything we've dreamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.14,1:06:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你创造历史的机会来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your chance to make history,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.14,1:06:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盗月神偷啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}become the man who stole the moon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.44,1:06:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显孩子们让你分心了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these girls are becoming a major distraction!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.32,1:06:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.40,1:06:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你下不了手 我帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't do something about it, then I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.08,1:06:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.25,1:06:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.88,1:06:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他屁屁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.26,1:06:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁屁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.02,1:07:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁屁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.06,1:07:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 现在我们来碰杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Now, when we put our cups together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.90,1:07:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后说 "叮"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will make the "clink" sound with our mouths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.65,1:07:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗? 伊迪丝?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready? Edith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.91,1:07:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 叮 - 叮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clink. - Clink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.03,1:07:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来碰下 现在可以喝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go. And now we drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.78,1:07:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接着艾格妮丝?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Agnes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.91,1:07:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 叮 - 叮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clink. - Clink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.08,1:07:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.16,1:07:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪下 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.92,1:07:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别走嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.13,1:07:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别着急 马上回来 你们先继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I'll be back. Keep clinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.13,1:07:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 叮 叮 - 叮 叮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clink, clink. - Clink, clink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.63,1:07:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈蒂小姐 找我有事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Hattie, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.59,1:07:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来接孩子们 我接到电话说 你想把她们送回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here for the girls. I received a call that you wanted to return them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.10,1:07:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 我买了本西班牙词典{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And also, I did purchase a Spanish dictionary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.77,1:07:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢你说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't like what you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.07,1:07:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.74,1:08:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我进去帮孩子们收拾下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will get the girls ready.{\r}
