Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.33,1:22:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底谁是拯救月球的英雄?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who is this mysterious hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.21,1:22:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来他会做什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what will he do next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.71,1:22:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 小家伙们 该睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, girls. Time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.59,1:22:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要! 讲个故事嘛 - 3只不想睡觉的小猫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! We want a story. - Three sleepy kittens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.38,1:22:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个不行! 抱歉 那本书不小心被撕坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Sorry. That book was accidentally destroyed maliciously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.05,1:22:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们换本新书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight we are going to read a new book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.35,1:22:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名字叫做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one is called{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.64,1:23:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大大独角兽 作者是谁呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One Big Unicorn by... Who wrote this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.10,1:23:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我! 我写的 瞧 也是木偶书!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me! I wrote it. Look, it's a puppet book!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.61,1:23:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.49,1:23:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是角!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the horn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.33,1:23:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书一定超级好玩儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be the best book ever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.50,1:23:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩别学拍马屁 不过你说的确实没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to pat myself on the back, but, yes, it probably will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.37,1:23:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.54,1:23:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"大大独角兽 强壮又自由"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"One big unicorn, strong and free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.63,1:23:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"他觉得自己是世上最幸福的家伙"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought he was happy as he could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.67,1:23:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"直到有天他遇到3只小猫"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then three little kittens came around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.47,1:23:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"从此他的生活天翻地覆"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and turned his whole life upside down."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.31,1:23:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 那个像我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that one looks like me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.14,1:23:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑? 这些是小猫咪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, what are you talking about? These are kittens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.35,1:23:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如有雷同 纯属巧合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any relation to persons living or dead is completely coincidental.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.65,1:23:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"她们时而让他捧腹"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"They made him laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.11,1:23:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"时而又哭笑不得"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made him cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.58,1:23:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"那句再见 他真不该说"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never should have said goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.87,1:24:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"现在他知道 他和那3只小猫"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now he knows he could never part{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.54,1:24:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"永远都分不开"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from those three little kittens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.63,1:24:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"她们改变了他的生活"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that changed his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.63,1:24:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"完了"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.80,1:24:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 该睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, all right. Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.45,1:24:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.62,1:24:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.67,1:24:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧 不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.72,1:24:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.85,1:25:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是刚亲过你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't I get you already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.84,1:25:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们超棒吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're very good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.93,1:25:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为你自豪 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so proud of you, Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.97,1:25:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是个合格奶爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've turned out to be a great parent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.02,1:25:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果然是遗传我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.10,1:25:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过也许更优秀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe even better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.68,1:26:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我就算了 你们玩吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm fine. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.14,1:26:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了 不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.24,1:28:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 卡尔! 过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Carl! Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.08,1:28:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对 不对 不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.25,1:28:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来 我来 我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, me, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.79,1:28:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.92,1:28:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不 是我 我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Me, me, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.11,1:28:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, poop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.86,1:29:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.91,1:29:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,犯规! 住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.60,1:30:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好呀 我是格鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, I am Gru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.06,1:30:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去工作了 回去工作了 回...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to work, back to work! Back to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.00,1:30:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
